─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PROPOSED IO THROTTLE VALUES
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Based on NVMe ~2000 MB/s sequential, ~50k IOPS random:

For K8s masters (1010, 1011, 1012):
  Read limit (MB/s):   100
  Write limit (MB/s):  50
  Read limit (ops/s):  2000
  Write limit (ops/s): 1000
  Read max burst (MB): 200    (2x for spikes)
  Write max burst (MB): 100
  Read max burst (ops): 4000
  Write max burst (ops): 2000

For K8s workers (1020, 1021, 1022):
  Read limit (MB/s):   200
  Write limit (MB/s):  100
  Read limit (ops/s):  3000
  Write limit (ops/s): 2000
  Read max burst (MB): 400
  Write max burst (MB): 200

For non-critical VMs (FreeIPA, vaults, ansible, templates):
  Read limit (MB/s):   50
  Write limit (MB/s):  25
  Read limit (ops/s):  1000
  Write limit (ops/s): 500

