ALSO: IO THREAD ENABLE
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

In Image 2, "IO thread" was unchecked.
Enabling this gives each virtio disk its own thread, improving IO
parallelism and isolation.

  qm set 1010 --scsi0 local-lvm:vm-1010-disk-0,iothread=1,...

BUT: requires VM stop/start to take effect (unlike throttle limits).

